Falsifies `system_tests::user::every_core_tick_budget_tests::a_budget_expiry_message_is_followed_by_a_thread_dump`.

Architecture: aarch64, riscv64, x86_64

The defect is `dump_threads_for_budget_expired` never printing, so a budget-expired failure carries
no thread states and no per-core `inbox_len`, and a lost wake cannot be told from slowness.

Expected to fail: `assert!(dump.contains("--- thread dump"), "the dump follows the message: {dump}")`.

